diff --git a/docs/cli.rst b/docs/cli.rst
index a096fdeaa7887dacb1a4d37aa15f76c4236763e6..0e2167f1b2acb6be5982f6e469c19426a1cf58d3 100644
--- a/docs/cli.rst
+++ b/docs/cli.rst
@@ -712,6 +712,17 @@ You can delete all the existing rows in the table before inserting the new recor
 
     $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs dogs.json --truncate
 
+You can extract repeated values from a column into a separate lookup table using
+``--extract column_name``. The original values will be replaced by foreign key
+references to that lookup table::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils insert trees.db trees trees.json --extract species
+
+The option can be repeated to extract more than one column::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils insert trees.db trees trees.json \
+        --extract species --extract region
+
 .. _cli_inserting_data_binary:
 
 Inserting binary data
